    <title>Extending Your Thinking</title>
    <para>Two non-negative numbers \(x\) and \(y\) satisfy \(x+y\leq1\).</para>
    <para>Find a second inequality, also using \(x\) and \(y\) values greater than or equal to zero, to make a system of inequalities with exactly one solution.</para>
    </problem><solution>
    
